# Garbled text: bit 0 of the video RAM UC3 reads 1 in every word: every character on the screen with an even code is the next one in the character set (B as C, D as E), spaces as !.
machine bw2001
title "Garbled text"
brief "The BW-2001 seems to start, but many characters on its screen are wrong, one letter along (CASIC for BASIC), and the empty screen is full of exclamation marks."
fault column UC3.IO1 1
